# Design implementation rules

Use the approved Figma screen documented in the active Spec as the visual
reference. Reuse the supplied local assets from `public/`; do not replace them
with remote substitutes. `public/background-fundo.png` is the page background.

Use the Syne font for game-related text. Record any intentional visual
departure from Figma in the relevant Spec and in `Specs/decisions.md`.
